core: hot plug into a live 28 V source (non-compliant), 1 uH/50 mR: CH224Q VHV (32 V abs)
.include models.inc
* core PVDD switch as on main: Q1 AO4485, R4/R5 470k, C4 100n G-D, C8 2.2u/50V G-S, D4 15 V clamp,
* Q2 2N7002 (S = PD_PG), R6 1k, R7 100k, R404 100k + D5 BAS16 + Q3 unit 2 fast-off follower,
* D2 33 V + R8/R9 10k + Q3 unit 1 OV trip, R20 10k PG pull-up. Bulk C5, C6, C311 470u/50V PX (ESR ~0.2 R).
Rcab vsrc vc 0.05
Lcab vc VBUS_IN 1u
R1 VBUS_IN VBUS 10m
* C10 10u/50V 1206 (2.6u at 28 V, 4.1u at 20 V) + C11 100n; R17 10R + C1 1u/50V 0805 (0.58u)
C10 VBUS 0 3u
R17 VBUS VBUS_PD 10
C1 VBUS_PD 0 0.6u
Rbuck VBUS 0 150
M1 PVDDm PVDD_G VBUS AO4485
Vfetm PVDD PVDDm 0
R4 VBUS PVDD_G 470k
R5 PVDD_G PVDD_PD 470k
C4 PVDD_G PVDD 100n
C8 VBUS PVDD_G 1.8u
D4 PVDD_G VBUS DZ15
M2 PVDD_PD PVDD_ENG PD_PG N2N7002
R6 PVDD_EN PVDD_ENG 1k
R7 PVDD_ENG 0 100k
R404 VBUS PVDD_PD 100k
D5 PVDD_PD PVDD_OFFB DBAS16
Q3B VBUS PVDD_OFFB PVDD_G Q3904
D2 OV_Z VBUS DZ33
R8 OV_Z OV_B 10k
R9 OV_B 0 10k
Q3A PVDD_ENG OV_B 0 Q3904
R20 PD_PG V3V3 10k
V3 V3V3 0 3.3
Spg PD_PG 0 vpg 0 SWPG
.model SWPG SW(Ron=30 Roff=1e9 Vt=1.5 Vh=0.1)
C5 PVDD p5 470u
R5e p5 0 0.2
C6 PVDD p6 470u
R6e p6 0 0.2
C311 PVDD p311 470u
R311e p311 0 0.2
* C7 10u/50V 1206 (2.6u) + 4 x 1u/50V 0805 (0.58u) + 4 x 100n
Ccer PVDD 0 5.3u
Ramp PVDD 0 14k
D1 0 VBUS_IN DTVS30

Vsrc vsrc 0 PWL(0 0 10u 0 10.2u 28 50m 28)
Vpg vpg 0 0
Ven PVDD_EN 0 0
.tran 0.1u 50m 0 0.1u
.meas tran vbus_pk max v(VBUS) from=0 to=50m
.meas tran vpd_pk max v(VBUS_PD) from=0 to=50m
.end
